# 🎮 Camera Eating Game

A desktop game controlled entirely by your**hand and facial movements* Built using real-time computer vision to track gestures through your webcam and turn them into in-game actions.

## Tech Stack
- Python
- OpenCV
- MediaPipe (hand/face landmark detection)
- cvzone
- Tkinter (GUI)

## Features
- Two playable game modes
- Real-time gesture tracking via webcam
- Simple, clean Tkinter menu to switch between games

## How to Run

pip install -r requirements.txt
python gui.py


## Notes
Make sure you have good lighting in front of the camera for accurate tracking.
